{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17775","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 二 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸳鹭彤庭际，轩车绮陌前。\n九城多好色，万井半祥烟。\n人醉逢尧酒，莺歌荅舜弦。\n花明御沟水，香暖禁城天。\n赐宴文逾盛，徴歌物更妍。\n无穷艳阳月，长照太平年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}